{"1401200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadows of Soldiers", "steam_appid": 1401200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A tactical third-person shooter focused on squad coordination and positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Outsmart enemies using real cover tactics, class abilities, and coordinated team play in intense 8v8 battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight across multiple modes including Conquest, where teamwork and smart positioning decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⚠️ Indie Project – Made by Only 2 Developers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Shadows of Soldiers</i> is a true <strong>indie project created by just two developers</strong>, with <strong>no publisher and no large studio behind it</strong>. Everything in the game — development, updates, servers, and publishing — is built and managed entirely by the two of us (and with a small team).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Features:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Meaningful cover-based combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Class-based gameplay with unique abilities </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Team-focused PvP modes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Loadout choices that impact strategy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Character and weapon customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3f9e5afade9a3b4f80ad2c46bd6fa79c.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=255 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Juggernaut:</strong> -  frontline tank, absorbs damage and breaks pushes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/d4b7fb339c169ec7ccab9444a577695b.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/9120bea9566cc0fb09959fae903900bd.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/9120bea9566cc0fb09959fae903900bd.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/9120bea9566cc0fb09959fae903900bd.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shadow</strong> - stealth flanker, punishes positioning mistakes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/884d88a94a3ecdaebe046c2e73eaf9fa.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/90e37a0ece42a4d483bf71907db0a469.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/90e37a0ece42a4d483bf71907db0a469.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/90e37a0ece42a4d483bf71907db0a469.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">     <strong>Commander </strong>- supports and controls the battlefield with tactical abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/e01a70356aae59f36ff7c0ac70c5ecae.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1560 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/23f13c4261a934a941f0df8b06ec0d64.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/23f13c4261a934a941f0df8b06ec0d64.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/23f13c4261a934a941f0df8b06ec0d64.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>                    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each class offers a choice of two unique abilities, allowing you to tailor your play style to perfection.<br> Strategically select one ability to equip and deploy in intense battles to turn the tide in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/139bed5eabaa890320dc23a9e091e22c.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquest </strong><br>Join large-scale battles in Conquest mode, where teams fight to capture and control strategic objectives across diverse maps. Each battlefield has its own atmosphere and background story, shaping the flow of combat and encouraging coordinated team play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch </strong>(hosted match only)<br>Jump into fast-paced firefights in Team Deathmatch, where the focus is pure combat and quick engagements. These maps are designed for intense encounters, rewarding precision, awareness, and aggressive teamwork.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/82f2d0da732f5cddd0e219b1ce85614d.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game's environment becomes your greatest ally. Utilize the intricately designed  cover system to shield yourself from incoming fire, survey the battlefield, and launch calculated counterattacks.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=478 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/484c1d740a3bf547416b2e4d26853b48.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Customization</strong><br>In <i>Shadows of Soldiers</i> gives you the freedom to modify multiple parts of your weapons, directly influencing their performance and statistics. Adjust your loadout to match your play style and create a weapon that truly fits how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appearance</strong> <strong>Customization </strong><br>Personalize your character with a plethora of armor, headgear, and outfits, making your warrior a true reflection of your style and personality.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ac44306f933d9f55b7a1ad8bbdb24c3b.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1170 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ac44306f933d9f55b7a1ad8bbdb24c3b.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ac44306f933d9f55b7a1ad8bbdb24c3b.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.avif?t=1781269897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras_big/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.webp?t=1781269897 width=1560 height=839 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/c8c134644236210b45c33fc6b8adfbd0.avif?t=1781269897\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We use Discord as our primary communication platform. Join to follow our progress, Be first to know our updates or find other like minded players to team up with. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/13053461652dc79122c24c332f3f8d90.avif?t=1781269897\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our YouTube to see the latest developments or watch our streams where the team have discussions and play the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Status Notice</strong><br><i>Shadows of Soldiers</i> is continuously evolving and actively being developed by a small indie team. The game already offers a solid gameplay experience, but we are constantly improving systems, features, and content as development progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As with any actively developed project, players may occasionally encounter bugs or ongoing balancing changes. Community feedback plays an important role in shaping the future of the game as we continue refining and expanding the experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A tactical third-person shooter focused on squad coordination and positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Outsmart enemies using real cover tactics, class abilities, and coordinated team play in intense 8v8 battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight across multiple modes including Conquest, where teamwork and smart positioning decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⚠️ Indie Project – Made by Only 2 Developers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Shadows of Soldiers</i> is a true <strong>indie project created by just two developers</strong>, with <strong>no publisher and no large studio behind it</strong>. Everything in the game — development, updates, servers, and publishing — is built and managed entirely by the two of us (and with a small team).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Features:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Meaningful cover-based combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Class-based gameplay with unique abilities </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Team-focused PvP modes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Loadout choices that impact strategy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Character and weapon customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3f9e5afade9a3b4f80ad2c46bd6fa79c.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=255 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Juggernaut:</strong> -  frontline tank, absorbs damage and breaks pushes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/d4b7fb339c169ec7ccab9444a577695b.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/9120bea9566cc0fb09959fae903900bd.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/9120bea9566cc0fb09959fae903900bd.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/9120bea9566cc0fb09959fae903900bd.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shadow</strong> - stealth flanker, punishes positioning mistakes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/884d88a94a3ecdaebe046c2e73eaf9fa.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/90e37a0ece42a4d483bf71907db0a469.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/90e37a0ece42a4d483bf71907db0a469.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/90e37a0ece42a4d483bf71907