 its own atmosphere and background story, shaping the flow of combat and encouraging coordinated team play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch </strong>(hosted match only)<br>Jump into fast-paced firefights in Team Deathmatch, where the focus is pure combat and quick engagements. These maps are designed for intense encounters, rewarding precision, awareness, and aggressive teamwork.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/82f2d0da732f5cddd0e219b1ce85614d.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game's environment becomes your greatest ally. Utilize the intricately designed  cover system to shield yourself from incoming fire, survey the battlefield, and launch calculated counterattacks.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=478 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/484c1d740a3bf547416b2e4d26853b48.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Customization</strong><br>In <i>Shadows of Soldiers</i> gives you the freedom to modify multiple parts of your weapons, directly influencing their performance and statistics. Adjust your loadout to match your play style and create a weapon that truly fits how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appearance</strong> <strong>Customization </strong><br>Personalize your character with a plethora of armor, headgear, and outfits, making your warrior a true reflection of your style and personality.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ac44306f933d9f55b7a1ad8bbdb24c3b.poster.avif?t=1781269897\" width=1170 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ac44306f933d9f55b7a1ad8bbdb24c3b.webm?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ac44306f933d9f55b7a1ad8bbdb24c3b.mp4?t=1781269897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.avif?t=1781269897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras_big/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.webp?t=1781269897 width=1560 height=839 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/c8c134644236210b45c33fc6b8adfbd0.avif?t=1781269897\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We use Discord as our primary communication platform. Join to follow our progress, Be first to know our updates or find other like minded players to team up with. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/13053461652dc79122c24c332f3f8d90.avif?t=1781269897\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our YouTube to see the latest developments or watch our streams where the team have discussions and play the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Status Notice</strong><br><i>Shadows of Soldiers</i> is continuously evolving and actively being developed by a small indie team. The game already offers a solid gameplay experience, but we are constantly improving systems, features, and content as development progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As with any actively developed project, players may occasionally encounter bugs or ongoing balancing changes. Community feedback plays an important role in shaping the future of the game as we continue refining and expanding the experience.</p>", "short_description": "Shadows of Soldiers is a competitive multiplayer third-person shooter built around tactical cover combat, squad coordination, and advanced class-based devices. Customize your soldier, adapt your loadout, and outplay enemies through positioning, teamwork, and modern military technology.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/4f97ba21e79a5948386f1875c5779738d7e9840a/header.jpg?t=1781269897", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/88138435487287513688fedeb5fce5a708ca3bd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781269897", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/88138435487287513688fedeb5fce5a708ca3bd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781269897", "website": "https://www.shadowsofsoldiers.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-7400 / Ryzen 5 1600 or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580 8GB or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is strongly recommended for stable performance.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 3600 / Intel i5-9600K or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super / RTX 2060 / AMD RX 5600 XT / RX 6600 or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>N